			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-876417">
									

<p>Something really doesn't click well with this SCP for me. It's a mannequin made by The Factory where it's implied everywhere that it's a real girl who was "converted" into said mannequin. It doesn't really feel like something The Factory would go for as a product line for me. You also threw in a testing log that gave it weapons and stated that it is an open log which is silly because essentially you're just playing dress-up with the doll.</p>
<p>I personally am not a fan.</p>

